  w111 0C013E0407  ?word   0x0C013E0407   ; C01.3.E0.407  {C-fmt A=159 B=0}  hi12{ESC ?10 ?0 res=401}  [C-format opcode 0x600: bits [24:12] are one 13-bit IMMEDIATE reaching into hi12 bit 0, not class+addr; A=159 B=0]
